# Scripted input for the player cross-check (tests/sim/playerTrace.test.ts).
# Each line: <ticks> <keys> [event]. Keys: U D L R F (fire) C (change fire) l r (sidekicks),
# "-" for none. Events fire before the first tick of the line, with the "enemy" at the player:
# P = front power-up (scoreitem, evalue -1), B = purple ball (30000), $ = coin (100),
# E = an air enemy with 10 armor (collision damage), X = the same after setting shield 0, armor 1
# (the player dies), T = a target enemy at (150, 30), W = level end (endLevel, levelEnd = 40).
# "!loadout <front> <rear> <left sidekick> <right sidekick> <power>" sets the items (+ JE_drawOptions).
